# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/android/local.properties
**/android/key.properties
**/android/.gradle
**/android/captures/
**/android/gradlew
**/android/gradlew.bat
**/android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release
*.apk
*.aab

